and design choices in the architecture of Personal LLM Agents, followe
d by an in-depth analysis of the opinions collected from domain expert
s. Next, we discuss several key challenges to achieve intelligent, eff
icient and secure Personal LLM Agents, followed by a comprehensive sur
vey of representative solutions to address these challenges.},
