	abstract = {Integrated Development Environments (IDEs) have become central to modern software development, especially with the integration of Artificial Intelligence (AI) to enhance programming efficiency and decision-making. The study of in-IDE Human-AI Experience is critical in understanding how these AI tools are transforming the software development process, impacting programmer productivity, and influencing code quality.

