	keywords = {Software quality, software engineering, Critical thinking, Teaching, Students, Codegeneration, Codes (symbols), Software design, Computer software selection and evaluation, Error correction, Software Quality, Education computing, Productivity gain, generative ai, Generative ai, Testing codes, Legacy systems, software quality, Real-world scenario, critical thinking, Educational experiences, Fundamental concepts, Legacy code},
